1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,176
Satu kilometer.

2
00:00:01,196 --> 00:00:02,522
Tapi ke atas.

3
00:00:02,542 --> 00:00:03,730
Bagaimana gedung setinggi itu

4
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:04,334
berdiri?

5
00:00:04,354 --> 00:00:05,510
Pada 2 November,

6
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:07,380
Jeddah Tower menembus lantai

7
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,600
120, sekitar 480 meter.

8
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,012
Sempat mangkrak sejak 2018,

9
00:00:13,032 --> 00:00:14,777
dilanjutkan 2025,

10
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:16,906
targetnya selesai 2028,

11
00:00:16,926 --> 00:00:18,243
lebih dari satu kilometer.

12
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:19,465
Fondasinya di batu karang

13
00:00:19,485 --> 00:00:20,130
berongga.

14
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,415
Ada 270 tiang bor,

15
00:00:21,435 --> 00:00:24,170
sedalam 45 sampai 105 meter,

16
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,502
diikat pelat beton setebal

17
00:00:25,522 --> 00:00:26,667
sekitar lima meter.

18
00:00:26,687 --> 00:00:27,472
Dari atas,

19
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:29,829
denahnya seperti huruf Y.

20
00:00:29,849 --> 00:00:31,299
Inti segitiga di tengah,

21
00:00:31,319 --> 00:00:32,749
tiga sayap menopangnya.

22
00:00:32,769 --> 00:00:34,420
Bebannya ditahan dinding,

23
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:35,431
tanpa kolom.

24
00:00:35,451 --> 00:00:36,963
Tiga kaki adalah jumlah

25
00:00:36,983 --> 00:00:38,439
minimum agar stabil.

26
00:00:38,459 --> 00:00:40,757
Satu pompa tidak sanggup,

27
00:00:40,777 --> 00:00:42,707
jadi betonnya direncanakan

28
00:00:42,727 --> 00:00:44,132
naik estafet.

29
00:00:44,152 --> 00:00:46,098
Pompa pertama sampai sekitar

30
00:00:46,118 --> 00:00:47,238
lima ratus meter,

31
00:00:47,258 --> 00:00:48,605
pompa kedua meneruskan.

32
00:00:48,625 --> 00:00:50,290
Musuh terbesarnya angin.

33
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,760
Angin membentuk pusaran

34
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,844
bergantian yang bisa

35
00:00:52,864 --> 00:00:54,104
mengayunkan gedung.

36
00:00:54,124 --> 00:00:55,667
Karena itu sayapnya makin ke

37
00:00:55,687 --> 00:00:56,806
atas makin pendek,

38
00:00:56,826 --> 00:00:58,462
jadi pusaran tidak sempat

39
00:00:58,482 --> 00:00:59,096
kompak.

40
00:00:59,116 --> 00:01:00,629
Semuanya diuji di terowongan

41
00:01:00,649 --> 00:01:01,378
angin.

42
00:01:01,398 --> 00:01:02,384
Di atas sekitar lima ratus

43
00:01:02,404 --> 00:01:04,116
meter, tali baja terlalu

44
00:01:04,136 --> 00:01:04,727
berat.

45
00:01:04,747 --> 00:01:06,105
Lift ke dek pengamatan memakai

46
00:01:06,125 --> 00:01:07,575
tali serat karbon,

47
00:01:07,595 --> 00:01:09,424
lebih dari 630 meter.

48
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:10,724
Liftnya melaju hingga sepuluh

49
00:01:10,744 --> 00:01:11,759
meter per detik.

50
00:01:11,779 --> 00:01:12,889
Di ujung menara,

51
00:01:12,909 --> 00:01:14,567
peredam massa meredam

52
00:01:14,587 --> 00:01:15,621
goyangan.

53
00:01:15,641 --> 00:01:16,780
Akar di karang,

54
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,733
tiga kaki,

55
00:01:17,753 --> 00:01:19,742
dan bentuk pengecoh angin.

56
00:01:19,762 --> 00:01:22,380
Ikuti AUDIRA untuk cara kerja

57
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,280
berikutnya.

